        "details": {
            "description": "<p>The items in the room, from the knick-knacks on the shelves to the logs burning in the fireplace, come to life and attack all creatures in the room.</p>",
            "disable": "<p>@Check[deception|dc:44], @Check[diplomacy|dc:44], or @Check[intimidation|dc:44] (expert) to convince the items to stop attacking, @Check[occultism|dc:40] or @Check[religion|dc:40] (expert) to exorcise the soul fragments in the items; four total successes are required to disable the hazard</p>",
            "isComplex": true,
            "level": {
                "value": 18
            },
            "publication": {
                "license": "ORC",
                "remaster": true,
                "title": "Pathfinder Adventure Path #225: Vaultlines"
            },
            "reset": "<p>The hazard resets 1 hour after it has been disabled. If destroyed, the hazard doesn't reset until Zyphaniss refurnishes the room, a project that takes several weeks.</p>",
            "routine": "<p>(4 actions) On each action, the hazard makes an animated object Strike against a different creature in the room. For each successful check made to disable the hazard, the haunt has 1 fewer action.</p>"
